# Stack

Generated by `/greenfield` from `docs/architecture.md`. Short on purpose.

- Stack: Next.js 15 and React 19 in `apps/web`, Next.js route handlers, Postgres through Prisma 6 (`@prisma/client` 6.19.3)
- Routes live in: `apps/web` route handlers; identity in `packages/auth`
- Schema lives in: `packages/db/prisma/schema.prisma`
- Test command: `pnpm test`
- Dev command: `pnpm dev` (Next.js on port 3000)
